---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: ext_price DESC NULLS FIRST, brand_id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: item.i_brand_id AS brand_id, item.i_brand AS brand, sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price) AS ext_price                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[item.i_brand, item.i_brand_id]], aggr=[[sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       Projection: store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price, item.i_brand_id, item.i_brand                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |  Projection: date_dim.d_date_sk, store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk, store_sales.ss_item_sk, store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price, item.i_item_sk, item.i_brand_id, item.i_brand                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Inner Join:  Filter: store_sales.ss_item_sk = item.i_item_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: date_dim.d_date_sk = store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk], full_filters=[date_dim.d_moy = Int64(12), date_dim.d_year = Int64(1998)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       TableScan: store_sales projection=[ss_sold_date_sk, ss_item_sk, ss_ext_sales_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_brand_id, i_brand], full_filters=[item.i_manager_id = Int64(20)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [ext_price@2 DESC, brand_id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[i_brand_id@1 as brand_id, i_brand@0 as brand, sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)@2 as ext_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=100), expr=[sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)@2 DESC, i_brand_id@1 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[i_brand@0 as i_brand, i_brand_id@1 as i_brand_id], aggr=[sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([i_brand@0, i_brand_id@1], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[i_brand@2 as i_brand, i_brand_id@1 as i_brand_id], aggr=[sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |             RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[ss_ext_sales_price@3 as ss_ext_sales_price, i_brand_id@5 as i_brand_id, i_brand@6 as i_brand]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                 SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                   BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                     VirtualExecutionPlan name=sqlite compute_context=memory base_sql=SELECT `date_dim`.`d_date_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_item_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_ext_sales_price`, `item`.`i_item_sk`, `item`.`i_brand_id`, `item`.`i_brand` FROM `date_dim` INNER JOIN `store_sales` ON (`date_dim`.`d_date_sk` = `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`) INNER JOIN `item` ON (`store_sales`.`ss_item_sk` = `item`.`i_item_sk`) WHERE (`date_dim`.`d_moy` = 12) AND (`date_dim`.`d_year` = 1998) AND (`item`.`i_manager_id` = 20) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
